  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile model using the scvi_n200 encoder instead of pca_n2000, achieving a validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 score of 0.6275, which exceeds the previous multiprofile baseline (0.5907 accuracy). The result suggests the scvi_n200 encoder may improve performance in this setting, though uncertainty remains about its relative effectiveness compared to other encoders or potential interactions with fusion strategies."
